--- !u!114 &1785221771
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1785221769}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8f9251a7f10f1e84997c917b973c3211, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    charactername: Rover
    sentences:
    - '

      Oh, you''re finally ready to drive!'
    - '

      Sorry about him. You were dozing off for a bit, and we were starting
      to get... concerned.'
    - '

      He was so worried about you, he was practically losing hair! I told
      him to calm down and see! You''re totally a-okay!'
    - '

      Hush, now. I''d hope you remember how to drive-'
    - '

      Don''t be patronizing, they''re a great driver!'
    - '

      I said hush. Use the keyboard WASD buttons to drive around.'
    - '

      Now, he dropped some cat food, so I need you to find it. It should
      be somewhere in this town.'
    - '

      But find it quickly, we are running out of time.'
    - '

      Yeaaaaah~ Let''s get cruisin''!'
